# Contact form submission endpoint (Contact.jsx). The site is a static
# Vite build with no server, so form submissions post directly to a
# third-party form-handling endpoint from the browser.
#
# Recommended: Formspree (https://formspree.io) — free tier, forwards
# submissions by email. Create a form there pointed at your inbox, then
# paste its endpoint below, e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=
